  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/spoorn/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label= &message=other projects&color=4b5966&labelColor=658f79&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label= &message=other projects&color=4b5966&labelColor=658f79&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"170\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/xfddZwG898\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/990178919795785749?color=4b5966&label= &labelColor=658f79&logo=discord&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/990178919795785749?color=4b5966&label= &labelColor=658f79&logo=discord&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornExtras\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/spoorn/SpoornExtras?color=4b5966&labelColor=658f79&label=github &logo=github&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/spoorn/SpoornExtras?color=4b5966&labelColor=658f79&label=github &logo=github&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"120\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornExtras/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-raw/spoorn/SpoornExtras?color=4b5966&labelColor=658f79&label=issues &logo=github&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-raw/spoorn/SpoornExtras?color=4b5966&labelColor=658f79&label=issues &logo=github&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"120\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">平滑地走上方块，替代自动跳跃。&nbsp;简单快速的模组。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">客户端模组</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">这基本上与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stepup\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stepup</a>&nbsp;功能相同，但现在已适配更新的 Minecraft 版本（1.18+）。不过底层代码完全不同，我们不再使用按键绑定来切换“上台阶”功能，而是采用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config 配置界面</a>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\">配置</h2>\n<p>配置文件位于你的 Minecraft 游戏目录下的 config/stepitup.json5。&nbsp;你可以在此启用或禁用“上台阶”功能，以及设置潜行时是否启用（修改后需重启游戏生效）。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>建议搭配<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu（模组菜单）</a>类模组使用，这样即可通过该模组菜单动态调整配置，而无需重启游戏。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>需要服务器吗？</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fspoorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KPURPK0.png\" alt=\"https://bisecthosting.com/spoorn\" width=\"1000\" height=\"158\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>致谢</h3>\n<p>全部代码由 spoorn 编写</p>\n<p>CurseForge 模组图标由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dimaalf/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">DIMaalF</a> 设计</p>",
